  "description": "GenericCRUDHelper is a lightweight and flexible library built on .NET Standard 2.0, designed to provide seamless and consistent CRUD (Create, Read, Update, Delete) operations across multiple database platforms.",
  "id": "GenericCRUDHelper",
  "isPrerelease": false,
